<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs fell 0.3 pct Jan-Nov.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs fell 0.3 pct Jan-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs fell 0.3 percent to 79.8 million tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996 compared to the same period in 1995, according to trade body Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>It said refinery crude runs rose 2.2 percent over this period while imported semi-finished products fell 20.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 5782501</p>
